    'dpdp-act-2023-section-31', 'dpdp-act-2023', 'The Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023', 'Section 31', 'Section 31 — Alternate Dispute Resolution (Mediation)',
    '31. If the Board is of the opinion that any complaint may be resolved by mediation, it
