    'dpdp-rules-2025-rule-1', 'dpdp-rules-2025', 'The Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025', 'Rule 1', 'Rule 1 — Short title and commencement',
    '1. Short title and commencement. — (1) These rules may be called the Digital Personal Data Protection 
Rules, 2025.  
(2) Rules 1, 2 and 17 to 21 shall come into force on the date of their publication in the Official Gazette. 
(3) Rule 4 shall come into force one year after the date of publication of this Gazette. 
(4) Rules 3, 5 to 16, 22 and 23 shall come into force eighteen months after the date of publication 
of this Gazette.', 'IN_FORCE', '2025-11-13', 'https://www.meity.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/11/53450e6e5dc0bfa85ebd78686cadad39.pdf', '', '[-0.078649,0.022003,-0.008933,-0.083127,0.007060,0.009556,-0.057373,-0.063229,-0.047609,0.038706,0.041729,0.066976,0.038058,0.000284,-0.030459,-0.033679,0.000247,-0.056303,-0.035465,0.022123,0.079068,-0.007237,-0.032442,-0.054001,-0.015705,-0.041886,-0.023325,-0.034042,0.010201,0.005856,-0.011196,0.002371,0.007396,0.050882,0.021364,-0.118197,0.054570,-0.004205,0.013103,-0.010049,-0.019440,-0.118411,-0.043626,0.056601,0.019819,0.063928,0.003375,0.058651,-0.075778,0.066166,-0.103577,-0.009866,-0.000995,0.073729,0.008720,-0.046141,-0.040180,0.029531,-0.076105,0.026447,-0.014129,-0.061640,-0.126992,0.009155,0.020096,0.040916,-0.027137,-0.037884,0.052401,0.047020,-0.053893,-0.005866,-0.045204,0.070726,-0.042079,-0.012112,-0.049457,0.020190,0.034677,-0.142274,-0.031957,0.002487,0.107190,-0.030575,-0.051316,-0.043001,-0.031738,0.059034,0.035796,0.016768,0.049369,-0.035421,0.084274,0.087887,-0.146427,-0.076069,-0.025625,-0.041035,0.092935,0.022062,-0.014141,0.047208,-0.090682,0.053006,-0.011005,-0.058741,0.013162,-0.005312,-0.018361,0.064756,-0.020025,0.097988,0.019887,-0.105580,-0.005342,-0.013228,-0.076064,0.066241,0.074754,-0.049702,0.003302,0.048893,-0.011075,-0.046314,-0.016164,0.001190,0.020178,0.000000,-0.015667,0.013252,-0.068318,0.018948,-0.002700,0.024063,-0.029997,0.014217,-0.038640,0.049424,0.019466,0.007739,-0.031810,-0.064954,0.019409,0.089325,0.012730,0.038744,0.049892,0.031810,0.119678,-0.163630,0.026965,0.045743,0.045561,0.007738,-0.027928,0.016289,0.056352,0.028656,0.021238,-0.035525,0.070455,0.008875,0.102605,0.046122,-0.000449,0.002940,0.060517,0.069791,-0.005890,0.009771,-0.051309,0.024926,-0.014863,0.028279,-0.009133,-0.021910,0.009921,-0.005661,0.035285,0.022577,-0.056609,-0.011434,-0.037184,0.016394,-0.068558,-0.120623,-0.019554,-0.023888,0.114729,0.009650,0.055629,-0.033374,-0.032925,0.010626,0.043112,-0.024773,0.