sovereignty and integrity of India or security of 
the State. 
Such officer of the State or of any of its 
instrumentalities notified under clause (a) of 
sub-section (2) of section 17 of the Act, as the 
Central Government or the head of such 
instrumentality, as the case may be, may 
designate in this behalf. 

[भाग II—खण् ड 3(i)] 
